{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"32de7a9bcd10931da7f2994078472650d8bb25547cdb10836fe8751aadca0086","digest":{"component_or_area":"verify-identity enforcement CLI and merge-gate","key_entities":["rebar verify-identity","rebar verify-authorship","--require-authenticated","--since","--format json","identity.enforce_since","REBAR_IDENTITY_ENFORCE_SINCE","src/rebar/_commands/verify_authorship.py","src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py","src/rebar/schemas/verify_identity_report.schema.json",".github/workflows/verify-identity.yaml","src/rebar/_config_schema.py","event_uuid","ticket_id","commit","author","verdict","display","grandfathered"],"problem_keywords":["verify-identity enforcement","merge-gate","grandfathering","JSON report","CLI command","authenticated events","commit ancestry"],"propositions":["The verify-identity command must be implemented as the canonical CLI entry point with verify-authorship as a back-compatible alias routing to the same handler.","The --require-authenticated flag must force enforcement on regardless of config state, while --since <ref> must grandfather pre-cutover events via git merge-base ancestry check and only fail the gate for enforced post-cutover non-verified events.","The --format json flag must emit a JSON array with entries containing event_uuid, ticket_id, commit, author, verdict, display, and grandfathered fields, validated against verify_identity_report.schema.json.","A CI merge-gate workflow must exist at .github/workflows/verify-identity.yaml that runs verify-identity --require-authenticated --since <identity.enforce_since> and fails on non-zero exit from enforced non-verified events.","The enforce_since config key must be added with environment variable REBAR_IDENTITY_ENFORCE_SINCE, and the CLI reference must be regenerated to document verify-identity and note the alias."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785823922527399781,"uuid":"efcc871c-6f8c-43cf-9a31-112e44c24059"}